usage: launch_server.py [options]

Server options:
  --model-path MODEL_PATH, --model MODEL_PATH
                        Model location.
  --context-length CONTEXT_LENGTH
                        Context length (default: None).
  --kv-cache-dtype {auto,fp8_e4m3,fp8_e5m2,bf16}
                        KV cache precision (default: auto).
  --attention-backend {flashinfer,triton,fa3}
                        Attention backend (default: flashinfer).
  --mem-fraction-static MEM_FRACTION_STATIC
                        Fraction of free memory (default: 0.88).
  --disable-radix-cache  Disable radix caching (default: False).
